# More than four lines asks first (Textual's possible-flood alert); the
# question comes after the text went into the history. A yes sends every
# line. Four lines go out at once.
! welcome
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
! type #c one\ntwo\nthree\nfour\nfive
? ui confirm-flood #c one\ntwo\nthree\nfour\nfive
? lines #c 1
! confirm
> PRIVMSG #c one
> PRIVMSG #c two
> PRIVMSG #c three
> PRIVMSG #c four
> PRIVMSG #c five
? line #c <textual> five
! type #c a\r\nb\n/topic t
> PRIVMSG #c a
> PRIVMSG #c b
> TOPIC #c t
! up
? field a\r\nb\n/topic t|
! up
? field one\ntwo\nthree\nfour\nfive|
? registered textual
